"Tahap blocking sebelum spline, project.json, Studio, dan 260 blok siap pakai.": "A blocking stage before the spline, project.json, Studio and 260 ready-made blocks.",
"ZIP berisi tiga skill (Motion Graphics Pro, Motion, Vektor), mgp, 260 blok, pustaka paket motion, dan catatan perubahan. Model suara dan gambar dipasang terpisah dengan mgp install.": "A ZIP with three skills (Motion Graphics Pro, Motion, Vector), mgp, 260 blocks, the motion pack library and the changelog. Voice and image models are installed separately with mgp install.",
"Perintah dan folder berbahasa Inggris (mgp, blocks/, project.json) dengan nama lama sebagai alias, pesan CLI dwibahasa, dan mgp audit sebelum render.": "English commands and folders (mgp, blocks/, project.json) with the old names as aliases, bilingual CLI messages, and mgp audit before the render.",
